 "audit": "Stored URL /en/p/size-guide now 404s; the chart is in Simply Be's own Help Centre (support.simplybe.co.uk). Official women's chart covers UK 8–32 (stored 10–24); cm values as printed beside the inches. Stored values were too small from UK 12 up: UK 12 bust 92 → 94, waist 75 → 77, hips 97 → 100; UK 16 bust 103 → 104, waist 86 → 89, hips 108 → 110; UK 20 bust 115 → 116, waist 98 → 101, hips 120 → 122; UK 24 bust 127 → 128, waist 110 → 113, hips 132 → 134. UK 10 waist 71 and bust 88 → 89, hips 93 → 95. UK 8 and 26–32 added. US/EURO from the same page's conversion table. The page notes the chart is for reference and sizes can vary between brands (Simply Be also sells other labels).",
